# Protect working Pro Yönetim release

## Locked (do not modify without explicit user approval)

- Live symlink: `/var/www/proyonetim/landing`
- Protected WhatsApp release: `/var/www/proyonetim/releases/whatsapp-baglanti-final-11988748-restored`
- Protected overview (KpiGrid + kompakt hero + SSOT): `/var/www/proyonetim/releases/overview-compact-20260722-092420`
- Feature freeze copies:
  - `/var/backups/proyonetim/feature-protection/PROTECTED-whatsapp-working-*`
  - `/var/backups/proyonetim/feature-protection/PROTECTED-overview-compact-*`
  - `/var/backups/proyonetim/feature-protection/PROTECTED-kpigrid-ssot-real-*`
- Do **not** start `radore-deployment-agent`

## Development only

- New work (billing, control panel, packages, etc.) only under:
  - `/var/www/proyonetim-staging/work/<feature>-YYYYMMDD-...`
  - or `/var/www/proyonetim/releases/<feature>-dev-*` / `*-staging-*`
- Never overwrite the protected WhatsApp router/src by copying an unrelated `config.tsx` onto it
- Do not switch live `landing` until the user explicitly says to publish/go live

## If live was changed by mistake

Restore immediately:

```bash
ln -sfn /var/www/proyonetim/releases/whatsapp-baglanti-final-11988748-restored /var/www/proyonetim/landing
```
